# Firebase CLIENT config files are deliberately NOT ignored — they must be
# committed or a fresh clone / CI fails with an opaque Gradle error.
# They are not secrets: google-services.json ships inside the APK, and its API
# key is restricted by package name + signing certificate. Do not re-add
# google-services.json / GoogleService-Info.plist here.

# Firebase / Google service-account PRIVATE KEYS.
# These are backend sending credentials and must NEVER be committed or shipped
# inside an app bundle — an APK is trivially unpackable. They belong on the
# server only.
*firebase-adminsdk*.json
*service-account*.json
*-serviceaccount.json

